# Build context for `service/Dockerfile`, whose context is this repository root.
#
# The root holds 780 MB of `assets/` (sample PDFs, WAVs, MP3s) and 115 MB of `tmp/`. None
# of it belongs in an image, and sending it to the daemon on every build is minutes of
# nothing. So: deny everything, then re-admit the three directories the service actually
# needs.
#
#   service/  the service itself
#   src/      the legacy AI pipeline it wraps -- `pipeline.extract`, `pipeline.speak`,
#             `pipeline.align_whisper`. See ai_engine/adapters/ai/legacy.py; the image is
#             non-functional without it.
#   tools/    the correction/verification helpers those modules import.
*

!service/
!src/
!tools/

# Nothing generated, cached, or secret, even from the admitted directories.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
service/.venv/
service/htmlcov/
service/.coverage
